Package: pulseaudio
Version: @DEB_PULSEAUDIO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/
Depends: libpulse0 (>= 17.0), libltdl7, libsndfile1, libglib2.0-0, xios-audio-server
Description: PulseAudio sound server for the Xios desktop
 The real PulseAudio daemon, built for rootless iOS. Hardware output goes
 through module-xios-sink, which forwards the mixed stream to xios-audiod
 (the CoreAudio RemoteIO daemon); PulseAudio itself never opens the device.
 Clients connect over the native protocol at /var/jb/tmp/pulse/native, which
 GNOME Shell's volume control (gvc) and ordinary libpulse apps speak.
 .
 Ships Xios-tuned daemon.conf, default.pa and client.conf plus the
 /var/jb/etc/profile.d/xios-pulse.sh session snippet (PULSE_SERVER export and
 xios_pulse_start).
